	<item title="Mercedes-Benz S600 DUB Edition" id="24">
			<text>The big-body Mercedes-Benz S600 may be a monolith of a German sedan, but this front-engine, all-wheel drive beast contains a 5.5-liter twin-turbo V12 with 510 HP.</text>
			
			<item type="vid" title="Car Vid" thumb="cars/mercedes600/t1.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/mercedes600/1.jpg?iwtfc" vid="video/hollywood/widget/flv/Mercedes S600_320.flv" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot" thumb="cars/mercedes600/t2.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/mercedes600/2.jpg?iwtfc" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		<item title="Audi R8" id="23">
			<text>With quick accelerdoation, high top speed and superior handling, the Audi R8 is an audacious entry into the world of super sport cars.</text>
			
			<item type="vid" title="Car Vid" thumb="cars/audir8/t1.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/audir8/1.jpg?iwtfc" vid="video/hollywood/widget/flv/Audi R8_320.flv" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot" thumb="cars/audir8/t2.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/audir8/2.jpg?iwtfc" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		
		
		<item title="Saleen S7" id="22">
			<text>Requiring an expert hand and steady nerves to handle properly, the Saleen S7 is a superlative supercar that can hit speeds of 250 mph.</text>
			
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 1" thumb="cars/saleen7/t1.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/saleen7/1.jpg?iwtfc" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 2" thumb="cars/saleen7/t2.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/saleen7/2.jpg?iwtfc" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		<item title="Mercedes-Benz SL65 AMG" id="21">
			<text>A rare example of stylish luxury and brawny performance, the Mercedes-Benz SL65 AMG is meant for those with an appreciation for the best of both worlds.</text>
			
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 1" thumb="cars/mercedesL65/t1.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/mercedesL65/1.jpg?iwtfc" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 2" thumb="cars/mercedesL65/t2.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/mercedesL65/2.jpg?iwtfc" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		<item title="Lamborghini Murcielago Roadster" id="20">
			<text>Named for a bull that defied death by sword 24 times, the Murcielago Roadster is one of the world’s most ferocious exotics.</text>
			
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 1" thumb="cars/murcielago/t1.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/murcielago/1.jpg?iwtfc" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 2" thumb="cars/murcielago/t2.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/murcielago/2.jpg?iwtfc" id="1"/>
		</item>
	
	
	
	
	
	
	
		<item title="1999 Nissan Skyline GT-R V-SPEC" id="19">
			<text>The cult-classic Skyline is a serious contender in the turns and drifts thanks to that renowned all-wheel drive and taut handling.</text>
			
			<item type="vid" title="Car Vid" thumb="cars/skyline/t1.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/skyline/1.jpg?iwtfc" vid="video/hollywood/widget/flv/Skyline_animrgb_320.flv" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot" thumb="cars/skyline/t2.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/skyline/2.jpg?iwtfc" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		<item title="Ducati 999R" id="18">
			<text>The preferred mount for World Superbike riders, the Ducati 999R combines lightning fast acceleration with sharp handling for a ride that requires an extremely delicate touch.</text>
			
			<item type="vid" title="Car Vid" thumb="cars/ducati/t1.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/ducati/1.jpg?iwtfc" vid="video/hollywood/widget/flv/Ducati WebclipAnimRGB_320.flv" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot" thumb="cars/ducati/t2.jpg?iwtfc" full="cars/ducati/2.jpg?iwtfc" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		<item title="1969 Ford Mustang Boss 302" id="17">
			<text>Massive torque and rear-wheel drive combine to give the Ford Mustang Boss 302 the edge up on would-be competition.</text>
			
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 1" thumb="cars/mustangboss/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/mustangboss/1.jpg?llsmd" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 2" thumb="cars/mustangboss/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/mustangboss/2.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		<item title="Mitsubishi Lancer Evolution IX MR" id="16">
			<text>With excellent traction and solid power, the Mitsubishi Lancer Evolution, or "Evo" as it is known, is a superior mid-level tuner that can hold its own against any challenger.</text>
			
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 1" thumb="cars/lancer/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/lancer/1.jpg?llsmd" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 2" thumb="cars/lancer/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/lancer/2.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		<item title="1971 Lamborghini Miura SV" id="15">
			<text>With a groundbreaking 380 HP, V12 mid-engine mount and a timeless chassis designed by famed Italian car designer Marcello Gandini, the Lamborghini Miura is one of the most rare and beautiful sports cars in the world.</text>
			
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 1" thumb="cars/miura/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/miura/1.jpg?llsmd" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 2" thumb="cars/miura/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/miura/2.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		
		
		
		
		<item title="Chevrolet Camaro Concept DUB Edition" id="14">
			<text>The Camaro Concept is proof positive that GM still knows how to deliver beauty and brawn in one superb package.</text>
			
			<item type="vid" title="Car Vid" thumb="cars/camaro_dub/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/camaro_dub/1.jpg?llsmd" vid="video/hollywood/widget/flv/Camaro__320.flv" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot" thumb="cars/camaro_dub/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/camaro_dub/2.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		<item title="1969 Chevrolet Camaro RS SS" id="13">
			<text>A top-of-the-line classic sports coupe that packs a 396-inch big block V8 engine, this rear-wheel drive monster is near impossible to beat in quarter mile sprints.</text>
			
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 1" thumb="cars/camaro_69/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/camaro_69/2.jpg?llsmd" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 2" thumb="cars/camaro_69/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/camaro_69/1.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		<item title="1979 Pontiac Firebird" id="12">
			<text>Powered by a 400-cubic-inch V8 and the improved stopping power of four-wheel disc brakes, the Trans Am is a red-blooded, ass-kicking true American original.</text>
			
			<item type="vid" title="Car Vid" thumb="cars/firebird/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/firebird/2.jpg?llsmd" vid="video/hollywood/widget/flv/Firebird US_320.flv" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot" thumb="cars/firebird/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/firebird/1.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		<item title="Dodge Charger SRT-8" id="11">
			<text>With the most powerful production engine Chrysler has ever produced, the Charger is a beast off the line and a champion on the straightaways.</text>
			
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 1" thumb="cars/charger/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/charger/2.jpg?llsmd" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 2" thumb="cars/charger/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/charger/1.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		<item title="Mazda RX-8 Shinka" id="10">
			<text>Capable of delivering over 237 HP and handling that shines in the curves, the RX-8 is one of the best sports cars available for less than $30,000.</text>
			
			<item type="vid" title="Car Vid" thumb="cars/shinka/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/shinka/1.jpg?llsmd" vid="video/hollywood/widget/flv/shinka.flv" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot" thumb="cars/shinka/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/shinka/2.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		
		
		
		
		
		
		
		
		
		
		
		
		<item title="Kawasaki Ninja ZX-14" id="9">
			<text>Quick as a whip, the ZX-14 is always first off the line, but proper handling at high speeds takes a sure and delicate touch.</text>
			
			<item type="vid" title="Bike Vid" thumb="cars/kawasaki/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/kawasaki/2.jpg?llsmd" vid="video/hollywood/widget/flv/Kawasaki Ninja Final anim rgb_320.flv" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Bike Shot" thumb="cars/kawasaki/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/kawasaki/1.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		<item title="Aston Martin V8 Vantage Roadster" id="5">
			<text>With a 4.3-liter V8 engine that produces 380 HP and a top speed of 178 mph, the Aston Martin Vantage is the complete package.</text>
			
			<item type="vid" title="Car Vid" thumb="cars/astonmartind/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/astonmartind/2.jpg?llsmd" vid="video/hollywood/widget/flv/Aston Martin US Anim RGB_320.flv" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot" thumb="cars/astonmartind/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/astonmartind/1.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		<item title="Volkswagen R32" id="6">
			<text>With it's 3.2-liter, 250 HP V6 engine and four-wheel drive Haldex drive system, this is a Rabbit built to run hard.</text>
			
			<item type="vid" title="Car Vid" thumb="cars/r32/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/r32/2.jpg?llsmd" vid="video/hollywood/widget/flv/VlksWagon_animrgb_320.flv" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot" thumb="cars/r32/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/r32/1.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		<item title="Pontiac Solstice" id="7">
			<text>With its distinct lines and respected handling, the Solstice's 177 HP powerplant delivers ample muscle to move the car's 2,877 pounds.</text>
			
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot1" thumb="cars/pontiac/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/pontiac/1.jpg?llsmd" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot2" thumb="cars/pontiac/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/pontiac/2.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		<item title="1999 Mitsubishi Eclipse GSX" id="8">
			<text>With a clean exterior that serves as a perfect palette for customization, the Eclipse is a street racing legend that will serve you well.</text>
			
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot1" thumb="cars/eclipse/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/eclipse/1.jpg?llsmd" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot2" thumb="cars/eclipse/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/eclipse/2.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		<item title="Saleen S302 Extreme" id="0">
			<text>Designed by Saleen to be the biggest, baddest production Mustang ever made, the S302 Extreme is one of the fastest muscle cars available.</text>
			
			<item type="vid" title="Car Vid" thumb="cars/saleen/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/saleen/1.jpg?llsmd" vid="video/hollywood/widget/flv/Saleen _FLA8_320.flv" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot" thumb="cars/saleen/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/saleen/2.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		<item title="Lamborghini Gallardo Spyder" id="1">
			<text>The Gallardo Spyder is the only convertible Lamborghini in production; with a 520 HP engine and six-speed manual transmission, it looks pretty but means serious business.</text>
			
			<item type="vid" title="Car Vid" thumb="cars/lamborghini/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/lamborghini/1.jpg?llsmd" vid="video/hollywood/widget/flv/Lamborghini US ANIM RGB_320.flv" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot" thumb="cars/lamborghini/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/lamborghini/2.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		<item title="Ford GT" id="2" >
			<text>Based on the original Le Mans-winning GT40, the Ford GT is a midengine marvel with a massive supercharged 5.4-liter V8 power plant, capable of 550 HP and a top speed of 205 mph.</text>
			
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot1" thumb="cars/fordgt/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/fordgt/1.jpg?llsmd" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot2" thumb="cars/fordgt/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/fordgt/2.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		<item title="Corvette Z06" id="3">
			<text>Considered firmly within the top echelon of America’s elite sportscars, the Chevrolet Corvette Z06 is a modern update of a timeless classic.</text>
			
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 1" thumb="cars/corvettez06/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/corvettez06/1.jpg?llsmd" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot 2" thumb="cars/corvettez06/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/corvettez06/2.jpg?llsmd" id="1"/>
		</item>
		<item title="Dodge Challenger Concept DUB Edition" id="4">
			<text>A perfect example of retro styling done right, the Challenger Concept is the hotly anticipated return of a classic American muscle car.</text>
			
			<item type="vid" title="Car Vid" thumb="cars/challenger/t1.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/challenger/1.jpg?llsmd" vid="video/hollywood/widget/flv/Dodge_FLA8_320.flv" id="0"/>
			<item type="img" title="Car Shot" thumb="cars/challenger/t2.jpg?llsmd" full="cars/challenger/2.jpg?llsmd" id="0"/>
		</item>
	</cars>
